#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:5 6a1eb81f2bf24beeb4bc330fbd56b85f
msgid "How to Operate"
msgstr "操作方法"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:7 fcdf8f83a70042749c0abc43f67de34e
msgid ""
"This page shows how to control the antenna tracker, mostly using the Mission"
" Planner."
msgstr "本页主要介绍如何使用 Mission Planner 控制天线跟踪器。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:11 c5522012fad148a6a212d7f695e1fbbc
msgid "Control Modes"
msgstr "控制模式"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:13 f8b49a98a4444cefb241c6fdfe703f77
msgid "There are five modes that you can place the antenna tracker in:"
msgstr "天线跟踪器有五种工作模式："

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:15 c6e8f12fe494476094843fa862c93ac0
msgid ""
"**Manual**: the operator directly controls the pan and tilt of the antenna "
"tracker to manually point it at the vehicle"
msgstr "**Manual**：操作者直接控制天线跟踪器的水平与俯仰，手动对准载具"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:17 13ce0ed6da3e41499db6f632b99d0f23
msgid "**Stop**: the tracker does not move"
msgstr "**Stop**：跟踪器不动"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:18 672433c64e79414f94f96be33f403b40
msgid "**Scan**: the tracker automatically scans looking for the vehicle"
msgstr "**Scan**：跟踪器自动扫描搜索载具"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:19 b0ab2f6d8a0a421ea38c4115a55a654c
msgid ""
"**Auto**: the tracker attempts to track the vehicle, scanning if it ever "
"loses contact"
msgstr "**Auto**：跟踪器尝试自动跟踪载具，失联时切换为扫描"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:21 33b1f1988be84585b4faa8d9e17da237
msgid ""
"**Servo_Test**: the servos are moved to the pwm values specified by a do-"
"set-servo MAVLink command.  Used by the mission planner's extended tuning "
"screen when the user pushes the \"test\" buttons."
msgstr ""
"**Servo_Test**：通过 do-set-servo MAVLink 指令将舵机移动到指定的 PWM 值。Mission Planner 的 "
"Extended Tuning 页面在用户按下「test」按钮时会使用该模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:25 26aae2d0eb3543f6b9af563e06e8035a
msgid ""
"The operator can set the current mode from the Mission Planner's Flight Data"
" screen's Actions tab's Set Mode button.."
msgstr ""
"操作者可在 Mission Planner 的 Flight Data 页面 Actions 选项卡下的 Set Mode 按钮中切换当前模式。"
